# Interaction Adapter

- DnDGem owns the interaction abstraction (`createDragInteraction` in `@dndgem/dom`).
- Initial web provider: `@dnd-kit/dom` (internal to `@dndgem/dom` only).
- Never import dnd-kit from `@dndgem/core` or `@dndgem/react`.
- Never expose dnd-kit types through DnDGem public APIs.
- Provider must remain replaceable (optional `mechanics` seam + rollback possible).
- Drag proposals update `LayoutIntent`; Core `solveLayout` remains authoritative.
- No custom native DnD engine in Phase 1.
